# Kind $3B's track platform (Kind3BPart2, $83:C0D7) waits a frame on a
# map quarter whose low bits are 6 or 7 (the case table at $83:C103,
# cases at $83:C113), which no track drawn in the levels the scripts
# reach has. Stage a5 s2 with Aladdin and the camera at x $0B80 (as
# unit_kind3b_rest.box): the track platform (record $0D8B, $07 = 2) runs
# left along the row at y $0080; its next steps read the map tile at x
# $0C00 (work RAM $7F1900, tile $6B68, case 1). That tile is made $03E0
# (every quarter case 6), then $0A38 (case 7), each for 20 frames, while
# the platform waits on it; then $2800 (case 4, the one way back no
# track here uses: the platform turns back there) for 4 frames; then put
# back, and the platform goes on.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a5_s2.state
wait 2
poke 0008E7 80,0B
poke 0008EA 80,00
poke 001773 00,0B
wait 100
poke 7F1900 E0,03
wait 20
poke 7F1900 38,0A
wait 20
poke 7F1900 00,28
wait 4
poke 7F1900 68,6B
wait 60
